Looking at the `clone()` method, it returns a copy of the list. The assertion states that every element in the cloned list (`\result`) matches the corresponding element in the original list (`this`) at the same index, for all valid indices.

The available observer methods are `get(int)` and `size()`.

<code>assert \forall int i; 0<=i && i<this.size(); ((ArrayList)\result).get(i).equals(this.get(i));</code>
